Copyright 2026 Miso

This product depends on @misofm/engine@0.1.0, published from
misofm/engine commit 5360874854f47e3dbfa2279ec6c57174e5ca018e.

The incremental SHA-256 implementation and verified-store/session-gate
invariants were adapted from the issue-authorized misofm/engine stem-store
baseline at commit bd7f330a9773ce43bb077f0e6d5c8fc30fe9e27c.

The bounded PCM pump, its serialized Worker self-drive/control queue, and MSB1
writer were adapted from that same authorized Engine baseline. The MSB1
allocation/reader contract was adapted from the
issue-authorized misofm/app browser composition baseline at commit
7485693e9bbcf2f65a91a4e5950e22d678d99062.

The AudioWorklet feed prelude and its attach-port mechanism were adapted from
that same authorized misofm/app commit. The prelude retains the Engine worklet
module unchanged and drains MSB1 through its existing synchronous Wasm ABI.

The dense-FLAC parser, packetizer, WebCodecs conversion, and bounded Worker
pipeline use issue-authorized implementation evidence from misofm/app commit
7485693e9bbcf2f65a91a4e5950e22d678d99062 and the preparation contract from
misofm/cli commit 94d94be1e858d01453ad4242e061ef2984502a00. The adapter's parser was
independently corrected to scan legal intervening metadata through the true
final metadata boundary.
